
Project Summary
===============
VFIG Website - A professional, authoritative website for the Dutch trade association of industrial gas manufacturers (Vereniging van Fabrikanten van Industriële Gassen). Features targeted navigation for three primary user groups: government, medical sector, and industrial sector, plus press contacts. Built with Next.js 15 and Tailwind CSS with a conservative Dutch professional aesthetic.

Architecture Overview
====================
Multi-page application using Next.js App Router with distinct paths for each user group. Follows conservative/authoritative design principles with blue-focused color scheme, structured layouts, and clear information hierarchy. Emphasizes trust, reliability, and regulatory compliance to match the highly regulated industrial gas sector.

